   "motion_no": 3,
   "motion": "To recommend file #REZ2023-000970 Kearns is considering a re-zone of approximately eight acres, located at 5622 South 5600 West. This re-zone is being initiated by Kearns Metro Township in order to increase General Plan conformity and enhance compatibility with adjacent uses, including the new commercial development on adjacent land within West Valley City. Planning staff will give a presentation of existing conditions and considerations for the re-zone. The Planning Commission will be asked to make a recommendation on the re-zone, following a public hearing to the Kearns Council for approval of Option 3 to rezone the property to Shopping Center Commercial (C-2) as initially requested. [OAM2023-000974]",
   "body": "PlanningCommission",
   "motion_type": "Land-Use/Zoning",
